WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.325
Unit two. Preventing Illness!

2
00:00:04.277 --> 00:00:07.968
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.018 --> 00:00:11.763
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.813 --> 00:00:15.757
Today we learn about Preventing Illness. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.497 --> 00:00:20.630
Immune system. Say it with me. Immune system!

6
00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.723
Vaccine. Say it with me. Vaccine!

7
00:00:31.218 --> 00:00:34.818
Hygiene. Say it with me. Hygiene!

8
00:00:38.307 --> 00:00:41.607
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

9
00:00:45.101 --> 00:00:48.984
Hydration. Say it with me. Hydration!

10
00:00:52.468 --> 00:00:55.968
Prevent. Say it with me. Prevent!

11
00:00:59.484 --> 00:01:03.234
Contagious. Say it with me. Contagious!

12
00:01:06.747 --> 00:01:10.730
Healthy habit. Say it with me. Healthy habit!

13
00:01:14.219 --> 00:01:24.916
My immune system fights germs to keep me healthy. A vaccine, good hygiene, enough rest, and hydration all help prevent illness. Some illnesses are contagious, so healthy habits matter.

14
00:01:24.966 --> 00:01:26.150
I can do that too!

15
00:01:27.391 --> 00:01:32.666
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:32.716 --> 00:01:33.866
Hygiene!

17
00:01:34.774 --> 00:01:39.945
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.995 --> 00:01:41.145
Contagious!

19
00:01:42.178 --> 00:01:49.292
Did you know? Your immune system remembers germs it has fought before, so it can fight them faster next time!

20
00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:51.250
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.936 --> 00:02:00.175
Think and answer. What healthy habits help prevent getting sick?

22
00:02:00.225 --> 00:02:01.375
Great answer!

23
00:02:02.468 --> 00:02:07.370
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:10.060
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

